WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.707
Forty applications.

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:07.403
The same questions every time.

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:09.650
Twenty hours of retyping.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.855
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.480
Queued jobs wait on the Queue tab, with warnings to check first.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.354
Found a job somewhere else?

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:23.610
Add it with a link, or the company and the title.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.527
On the company's own form,

00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:35.392
the extension fills what it can from your details and earlier answers.

00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:37.060
It never presses Submit.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.770
You check every field, and you send it.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.663
On a LinkedIn list, it reads the jobs and says how many jobwatch already had.

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:49.530
Read the same list again, and it says so.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.678
Companies whose jobs keep turning up, but whose board you don't watch,

00:00:57.678 --> 00:00:59.150
are suggested on Today.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.415
Job alerts and replies from application emails come in from your own mailbox.
